     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks Joe... it worked fine.. please find the below mentioned code for the same.. thanks again...</div><div><br></div><div>library(shiny)</div><div>options(error=browser)</div><div>shinyServer(function(input, output, session) </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>{</div><div>  </div><div>  output$contents &lt;- renderTable({</div><div>    </div><div>    if (input$header== TRUE)</div><div>    {</div><div>      infile &lt;- input$file1</div><div>      if (is.null(input$file1)) {return(NULL)}</div><div>      read.csv(infile$datapath)</div><div>    } </div><div>    else </div><div>    {        </div><div>      infile &lt;- input$file1</div><div>      if (is.null(input$file1)) {return(NULL)}</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>      tmp &lt;- strsplit(input$value,&quot;,&quot;)[[1]]</div><div>      read.csv(infile$datapath,header=FALSE,col.names=tmp)</div><div>      }</div><div>  })</div><div>})</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>On Thursday, June 4, 2015 at 1:26:11 AM UTC+5:30, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Definitely don&#39;t use `cat()`, that won&#39;t help you at all.<br><br><div>That aside, input$value will be a single-element character vector--you probably want a character vector with one element per column. Take a look at the strsplit function, for example if the column names are space separated it&#39;d be cols &lt;- strsplit(input$value, &quot; &quot;)[[1]]. Or if separated by commas with optional whitespace, then cols &lt;- strsplit(input$value, &quot;\\\\s*,\\\\s*&quot;)[[1]].</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Jun 3, 2015 at 10:38 AM Santhana Krishnan &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">a.sant...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;color:rgb(118,118,118);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,228,230);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;font-family:Helvetica,arial,nimbussansl,liberationsans,freesans,clean,sans-serif,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;line-height:18.2000007629395px;background-color:rgb(242,248,250)\"><div style=\"max-width:78%;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/calculus-ask\" style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);background-color:transparent\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/calculus-ask&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398426482000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zJ628yWeW6fpnHxAHKOyZ\">calculus-ask</a> </strong>commented <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/853#issue-84474424\" style=\"color:inherit;white-space:nowrap;background-color:transparent\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/853%23issue-84474424&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398426482000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bcZgmgtLUVKnixkRDz_50\">8 hours ago</a></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,nimbussansl,liberationsans,freesans,clean,sans-serif,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><div><div style=\"overflow:visible;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;word-wrap:break-word;width:694px;padding:15px\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">If we input <a href=\"http://col.name\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://col.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398426482000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3vvL5dnThHCP_B7ak8t5Dt\">col.name</a> = input$textinput in read.csv --&gt; we are getting this bug... My sample file has three column without headers..<br>i have tried with several iterations<br><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/wch\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;background-color:transparent\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wch&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398426482000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CZ1Dapnc3miRPzV_hj3kh\">@wch</a> please check.. cat is also not working</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">library(shiny)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">shinyServer(function(input, output,session) <br>{<br>output$contents &lt;- renderTable({</p><pre style=\"overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;margin-bottom:16px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\">      if (input$header== TRUE) \r\n      {\r\n        infile &lt;- input$file1\r\n        if (is.null(input$file1)) {return(NULL)}\r\n        read.csv(infile$datapath)\r\n      }\r\n    else\r\n      {\r\n        infile &lt;- input$file1\r\n        if (is.null(input$file1)) {return(NULL)}\r\n        cols &lt;- cat(input$value)\r\n        read.csv(infile$datapath,header=FALSE,col.names=cols)\r\n      }\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">})})</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">library(shiny)<br>shinyUI(fluidPage(</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">titlePanel(&quot;The Ace!&quot;),<br>navbarPage(&quot;Calulus@Work&quot;,<br><br>tabPanel(&quot;About Tool&quot;<br>),<br>navbarMenu(&quot;Data Load&quot;,<br>tabPanel(&quot;Delimter&quot;,<br>sidebarLayout(<br>sidebarPanel(fileInput(&#39;file1&#39;, &#39;Choose file to upload&#39;,<br>accept = c(&#39;text/csv&#39;,<br>&#39;text/comma-separated-values&#39;,<br>&#39;text/tab-separated-values&#39;,<br>&#39;text/plain&#39;,&#39;.csv&#39;,&#39;.tsv&#39;<br>)),<br>checkboxInput(&#39;header&#39;, &#39;Header&#39;, TRUE),<br>textInput(&quot;value&quot;,&quot;Enterhere&quot;,&quot;&quot;)<br>),<br>mainPanel(<br>tableOutput(&#39;contents&#39;)))))</p><pre style=\"overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;margin-bottom:16px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;padding:16px;border-radius:3px;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.8999996185303px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\">    